{"availability":"available","full":"aidline-org/aidline-backend","name":"aidline-backend","description":"Indexer and API for Aidline: mirrors Soroban contract events into Postgres and serves campaigns, proofs, donors and stats.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":3,"created":"2026-10-03T01:26:03Z","updated":"2026-10-09T00:29:13Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://aidline-frontend.vercel.app","topics":["charity","climate","diaspora","disaster-relief","fastify","indexer","postgres","soroban","stellar","typescript"],"demo":"https://aidline-frontend.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:07.739Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:07.739Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:07.739Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:44:15.450Z","stars":0,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-11T22:39:07.739Z","stars":0,"forks":3}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live demo: aidline-frontend.vercel.app · API: aidline-api.onrender.com · Stellar testnet","API and Soroban event indexer for Aidline, where diaspora communities fund disaster relief and climate work back home, with proof it landed. Built on Stellar.","The Aidline contract holds donations in escrow and releases them milestone by milestone after a verifier confirms the work. This service makes that on chain activity easy to use:"],"features":["Indexer: follows contract events on Soroban RPC and mirrors campaigns, donations, milestone releases, refunds and verifiers into Postgres.","Metadata: stores campaign stories (title, description, location, image) and returns a URI that gets written on chain.","Proofs: verifiers upload photos, receipts and reports before approving a milestone. The proof URI is emitted on chain, so every payout links to its evidence.","API: campaign listings, campaign detail with a milestone timeline, donor history, verifier directory and platform stats for the frontend."],"source